{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09052","headline":"园林晏起寄昭应韩明府卢主簿 · 韦应物","name":"园林晏起寄昭应韩明府卢主簿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"田家已耕作，井屋起晨烟。\n园林鸣好鸟，闲居犹独眠。\n不觉朝已晏，起来望青天。\n四体一舒散，情性亦忻然。\n还复茅檐下，对酒思数贤。\n束带理官府，简牍盈目前。\n当念中林赏，览物遍山川。\n上非遇明世，庶以道自全。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09052.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09052","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}